[A]dillagi yeh nahi [D]... ye hai.. [E]dil ki lagee
[A]andhiyon ko [D]chupaney se [A]kya faayada
[A]pyar [D]dil mein [E]chupaney se [Bm]kya faayadaaaa
[Bm]Jaan Se [E]Pyaara Jab [A]Dildar Hone Lage
[Bm]bol do gar [C#]tumhe pyar hone lage...
[C#]hone [E]lage pyar [F#m]hone lage
